  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> The bearer braces behind a physical shield when a nearby enemy attacks. Requires an embedded Item named Shield on the bearer. The effect only offers its +2 AC reaction when the shield item is present.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
